  "content": {
    "id": "p17-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Solve the following for $\\theta\\in[0,2\\pi]$, correct to three decimal places.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p17-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sin\\theta=0.316$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=0.322,2.820$.",
          "worked": "Sine is positive in quadrants I and II. Use radians mode and retain the unrounded inverse value.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha&=\\arcsin(0.316),\\\\\\theta&=\\alpha,\\pi-\\alpha,\\\\\\theta&\\approx0.322,2.820.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 21
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$2\\cos\\theta=-0.689$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=1.923,4.361$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\theta&=-\\frac{0.689}{2},\\\\\\cos\\theta&=-0.3445.\\end{align*}$$\nCosine is negative in quadrants II and III. In radians mode,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\beta&=\\arccos(-0.3445),\\\\\\theta&=\\beta,2\\pi-\\beta,\\\\\\theta&\\approx1.923,4.361.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q7-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{3}{7}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=0.405,3.547$.",
          "worked": "Tangent is positive in quadrants I and III. Use radians mode and retain the unrounded inverse value.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha&=\\arctan\\left(\\frac{3}{7}\\right),\\\\\\theta&=\\alpha,\\pi+\\alpha,\\\\\\theta&\\approx0.405,3.547.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 21
      }
    ]
  },
